  "bodyHash": "83a00f97994e15b1",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「Healing Campfire（治癒營火）」會在營火周圍建立一個區域，在可設定範圍內，玩家和／或無害生物會獲得再生效果。只要模組新增的無害實體<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>不</em></span>被分類為\"<em>EntityClassification.Monster</em>\"，也會受到治癒。當實體剩餘的再生效果時間不到一半且位於營火附近時，效果時間將重新計算。<br><br></span><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:16px\">1.16 版本的<span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\">靈魂營火</span>已相容！此功能可於設定檔中調整。</span></strong><br>您也可以參考 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-hostiles-around-campfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">營火周邊無敵對生物</a></strong></span>。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套裝\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForCampfireDelayInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 40，最小值 1，最大值 1200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組以「刻」為單位檢查玩家周圍營火的頻率。1 秒等於 20 刻，因此預設每 2 秒檢查一次。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>healingRadius&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 16，最小值 1，最大值 64</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家獲得再生效果的營火周圍方塊半徑。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>effectDurationSeconds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 60，最小值 1，最大值 600</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">營火施加的再生效果持續時間（秒）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>regenerationLevel</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1，最小值 1，最大值 50</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">營火施加的再生效果等級，預設為 1。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>healPassiveMobs&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，營火會治癒周圍的無害生物，治癒半徑為實體碰撞箱寬度的一半。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideEffectParticles&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，隱藏營火周圍再生效果的粒子特效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeLit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，營火僅在點燃狀態下才會生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeSignalling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，營火僅在接收紅石訊號時才會生效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>1.16+ 專屬設定選項：</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForNormalCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，此模組將與一般營火一同運作。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForSoulCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，此模組將與靈魂營火一同運作。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">營火周圍的再生效果：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-campfire/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於模組頁面眾多，我無法逐一追蹤，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
